  "description": "Ga-Ram, a reclusive and introverted otaku, starts the beautiful girl dating simulation \"Knock, Knock, Knock Real Love\" on the recommendation of his friend Seo-Ah. Among countless beautiful girls, the person who captured Ga-Ram's heart is none other than the charming and dependable father of \"Kwon Ye-Na,\" \"Kwon Tae-Oh\"! Ga-Ram was approaching \"Ye-Na\" to get \"Teo-Oh\" but he chose the wrong option... Due to a system error, he became the main character of \"Knock, Knock, Knock Real Love?!\" \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
